OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fbecome very windy with Storm Boelo
OL,7,Fbringing gales or severe gales.
OL,8,FFrequent and occasionally heavy
OL,9,Fshowers spread in from the west
OL,10,Fthrough the evening and overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FStorm Boelo will bring
OL,13,Fwesterly severe gales and frequent
OL,14,Fheavy showers or longer spells of
OL,15,Frain. Winds easing with some drier
OL,16,Finterludes developing later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
